1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,500
They tell us if you speak in Dutch, you the best. If it's English, you the best. French is the best.

2
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:09,840
Spanish is the best. American is the best. And all of us hating each other.

3
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:14,720
When in fact we are one people from one Caribbean with one struggle and one destiny.

4
00:00:25,230 --> 00:00:33,210
We see it therefore as one of our historic duties and responsibilities to pull down these artificial

5
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:40,030
barriers of colonialism and to develop that oneness and that unity that we nearly lost.

6
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:47,330
We believe it is critically necessary to have close relations with all of our neighbours.

7
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:57,170
But there is also a third reason that we will always have relations, warm, fraternal, close relations

8
00:00:57,170 --> 00:01:05,550
with the people of government of Cuba. And that is our admiration and our respect for the

9
00:01:05,550 --> 00:01:09,470
internationalism and the achievements of the Cuban people.

